WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:01.950
Every messenger is down.

2
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.400
Don't panic. I know what to do.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.000
You install the TorgLink messenger
on all your devices,

4
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.500
and I set up the server —
everything will be okay.

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.150
Wow!
